County","/arc-plc/nebraska/merrick-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. On that same middle, June to July ran 195% of normal in 2025 while November to December 2025 ran 25%. Grid 25327 saw its driest year in 2012, at 53% of normal.</p>"}
